WEBVTT

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.943
I almost never have to look at the time,

00:11:31.943 --> 00:11:34.497
and every morning when I wake up,

00:11:34.497 --> 00:11:36.858
really the day stretches in front of me

00:11:36.858 --> 00:11:39.832
like an open meadow.

00:11:39.832 --> 00:11:43.028
And when life throws up
one of its nasty surprises,

00:11:43.028 --> 00:11:44.989
as it will, more than once,

00:11:44.989 --> 00:11:47.170
when a doctor comes into my room

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:49.065
wearing a grave expression,

00:11:49.065 --> 00:11:52.693
or a car suddenly veers
in front of mine on the freeway,

00:11:52.693 --> 00:11:55.437
I know, in my bones,

00:11:55.437 --> 00:11:58.147
that it's the time I've spent
going nowhere

00:11:58.147 --> 00:12:00.149
that is going to sustain me much more